  "meta": {
    "description": "Reusable. For any stage of kind=fanout: runs the stage, asks the backend for its work items (for example the specialists chosen from the REGISTRY; never named here), runs them in parallel batches of max_parallel and fans in. An item failing never fails the run: the backend records it as unavailable.",
